WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:08.580
Find an item, issue it to a work order, and reorder everything running low in one click.

2
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:15.900
Stock lists every item in the store, how many are on hand and what they are worth.

3
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.060
Search by code, name or shelf.

4
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.200
Open the item.

5
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.630
To take parts out of the store, use Issue.

6
00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.390
How many.

7
00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:37.590
And the work order they are for. The cost goes onto that job.

8
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:43.730
Issue from the store. The movement is logged with who and when.

9
00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.820
Back on Stock, items under their minimum are marked.

10
00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:53.460
Request everything running low makes one purchase request with the right quantities.
